 (dono par الْـ)"],["Mu'annas Sifat-Mawsoof","آيَةٌ بَيِّنَةٌ / كَلِمَةٌ طَيِّبَةٌ","Khuli nishani / Paakiza kalimah (dono ke aakhir mein ة)"]]}},{"id":"sec_s3l1_concept","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"<div class=\"lesson-concept-svg\" style=\"margin:14px 0;padding:12px;border-radius:12px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#0f172a,#1e293b);border:1px solid #334155;\">\n<svg viewBox=\"0 0 760 190\" width=\"100%\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\">\n  <defs>\n    <linearGradient id=\"u123grad\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"1\" y2=\"1\">\n      <stop offset=\"0%\" stop-color=\"#0d9488\"/>\n      <stop offset=\"100%\" stop-color=\"#0284c7\"/>\n    </linearGradient>\n  </defs>\n  <rect x=\"8\" y=\"8\" width=\"744\" height=\"174\" rx=\"12\" fill=\"#0f172a\" stroke=\"#1e293b\" stroke-width=\"2\"/>\n  <rect x=\"22\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"26\" rx=\"13\" fill=\"url(#u123grad)\"/>\n  <text x=\"97\" y=\"37\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"12\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">UNIT 3 • LESSON 1</text>\n  <text x=\"188\" y=\"38\" fill=\"#f8fafc\" font-size=\"15\" font-weight=\"700\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Murakkab-e-Tawseefi (Sifat-Mawsoof 1): عَظِيمٌ ← شَيْءٌ عَظِيمٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ (Page 77–79)</text>\n  <rect x=\"24\" y=\"58\" width=\"220\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#1e293b\" stroke=\"#475569\"/>\n  <text x=\"134\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#fbbf24\" font-size=\"24\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">عَظِيمٌ ، كَبِيرٌ ، مُبِينٌ</text>\n  <circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"92\" r=\"22\" fill=\"#0d9488\"/>\n  <text x=\"288\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#ffffff\" font-size=\"14\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">Sifat + Mawsoof</text>\n  <rect x=\"332\" y=\"58\" width=\"402\" height=\"68\" rx=\"10\" fill=\"#0f292a\" stroke=\"#14b8a6\" stroke-width=\"1.5\"/>\n  <text x=\"533\" y=\"98\" fill=\"#34d399\" font-size=\"23\" font-weight=\"700\" text-anchor=\"middle\" direction=\"rtl\" font-family=\"Traditional Arabic,Amiri,serif\">شَيْءٌ عَظِيمٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"150\" fill=\"#cbd5e1\" font-size=\"12.5\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• عَظِيمٌ ، كَبِيرٌ ، مُبِينٌ (Bada, wazih) se شَيْءٌ عَظِيمٌ ، عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ (Badi cheez, bada azaab) banta hai.</text>\n  <text x=\"26\" y=\"170\" fill=\"#94a3b8\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\">• Sifat-Mawsoof, Izaafat, Asmaa-ul-Faa'il aur Tasniyah Qur'ani tarakeeb ki buniyaad hain.</text>\n</svg>\n</div>\n**Qaa'ida (Pages 77–79):** Arbi mein jab kisi ism (Mawsoof) ki achhai, burai ya haalat (Sifat) bayan ki jati hai toh **Mawsoof pehle** aur **Sifat baad mein** aati hai (`شَيْءٌ عَظِيمٌ` badi cheez). Dono ki aakhri harkat (`ـٌ / ـً / ـٍ`), `الْـ` ka hona ya na hona, aur muzakkar/mu'annas hona bilkul yaksaan hota hai."}},{"id":"sec_s3l1_r1","type":"rule_paragraph","data":{"text":"Unit 3 mein hum Murakkab-e-Tawseefi seekhenge — yani Noun aur Adjective ka Qurani murakkab. Sifat hamesha Mausoof ke baad aati hai aur dono ka irab aur jins milta hai. Neeche di gayi Qurani ibaarat mein adjective laal rang mein hai."}},{"id":"sec_s3l1_lbl2","type":"section_label","data":{"text":"عَظِيمٌ — Azeem (Bada / Azeemush-shaan)"}},{"id":"sec_s3l1_g3","type":"two_col_numbered_list","data":{"is_numbered":false,"items":[{"id":"s3l1_g3_w1","arabic":"شَيْءٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">شَيْءٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Badi cheez","translations":{"en":"A tremendous thing","ur":"بڑی چیز","hi":"बड़ी चीज़"}},{"id":"s3l1_g3_w2","arabic":"أَجْرٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"arabic-root\">أَجْرٌ</span> <span class=\"nonroot\">عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Bada ajr","translations":{"en":"A great reward","ur":"بڑا اجر","hi":"बड़ा अज्र"}},{"id":"s3l1_g3_w3","arabic":"عَذَابٌ عَظِيمٌ","arabic_markup":"<span class=\"nonroot\">عَذَابٌ</span> <span class=\"arabic-root\">عَظِيمٌ</span>","hinglish":"Bada azab",